<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As of June 30, 2026, we were
not subject to any market or interest rate risk.&#160;&#160;Following the consummation of our Initial Public Offering, the net proceeds
